WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
SMC Crows v3.2. Your copilot, ready to go. Coming 4 November 2026.

00:04.000 --> 00:10.000
Six assistants: Riko, Ning, Rom, Joanna, Iori and Mila.

00:10.000 --> 00:16.000
Play. Ask. Tools. One floating bar, with account and phone tools grouped together.

00:16.000 --> 00:22.000
Illustrated chat flow: ask for account backup help or check whether your setup is ready.
Confirmation and file choice stay with you.

00:22.000 --> 00:28.000
Seven setup languages: English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese,
Japanese, Korean, Thai and Indonesian.

00:28.000 --> 00:34.000
Back up and recover retained accounts, check setup status and use reversible phone-based graphics profiles.
Compatibility and performance vary by phone.

00:34.000 --> 00:40.000
SMC Crows mobile launcher v3.2. Release: 4 November 2026.
irfanfahmi.com/smc. Downloads remain paused until release.
